        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Closed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Merged": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已合并"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draft": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "草稿"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn’t remove %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法移除 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removed from PATH.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已从 PATH 中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Terminal at Home": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在个人文件夹新建终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Line height applies to the file editor and diffs; the terminal keeps the font’s own. Font and theme values you haven’t set here follow your Ghostty config.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "行高应用于文件编辑器和差异对比；终端保持字体自身的行高。此处未设置的字体与主题项将沿用你的 Ghostty 配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Termio can show %@'s token usage and plan limits by reading its local session logs and its `credentials/kimi-code.json` sign-in. Nothing is read until you allow it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Termio 可通过读取 %@ 的本地会话日志及其 `credentials/kimi-code.json` 登录信息，显示其 token 用量和套餐限额。在你允许之前不会读取任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Minimize": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最小化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zoom": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缩放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bring All to Front": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前置全部窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On iPhone, tap the Mac pill ▸ Scan QR Code. Traffic crosses the relay you run yourself — no third party in the path.": {
      "comment": "Footer under Settings ▸ Mobile ▸ Connect iPhone when the user runs their own relay. “Mac pill” is a control in the iPhone app and ▸ separates steps in a menu path.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 上轻点 Mac 胶囊按钮 ▸ 扫描二维码。流量经由你自己运行的中继，路径中没有第三方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On iPhone, tap the Mac pill ▸ Scan QR Code. The tunnel address works from any network, and terminates on the provider's servers. Pick Custom to run your own relay instead.": {
      "comment": "Footer under Settings ▸ Mobile ▸ Connect iPhone when a bundled third-party tunnel is selected. “Custom” names another entry in the same picker — translate it identically.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 上轻点 Mac 胶囊按钮 ▸ 扫描二维码。隧道地址可在任意网络使用，并终结于服务商的服务器。若要改用自己的中继，请选择“自定义”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "URL Pattern": {
      "comment": "Label for the Settings ▸ Mobile field holding a regular expression that matches the public URL a self-hosted tunnel prints on start-up.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "URL 模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not a valid regular expression": {
      "comment": "Inline warning shown beneath the URL Pattern field when what the user typed does not compile as a regular expression.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不是有效的正则表达式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply": {
      "comment": "Button that saves the custom tunnel command and restarts the tunnel.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs on this Mac with your privileges when Custom is selected — no shell, arguments split on spaces. Use {port} for the companion port; the URL pattern is a regex matching the public https URL your relay prints.": {
      "comment": "Help text beneath the custom tunnel fields. “{port}” is a literal token the app substitutes at runtime — keep it exactly as written. “Custom” names an entry in the tunnel picker above.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择“自定义”后，该命令会以你的权限在这台 Mac 上运行——不经过 shell，参数按空格拆分。用 {port} 表示配套端口；URL 模式是用于匹配中继输出的公开 https URL 的正则表达式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Font": {
      "comment": "Category grouping the font-size shortcuts in Settings ▸ Keyboard.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The coding agents offered when you start a session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建会话时可以选用的编程 Agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag the list to change the order agents appear in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动列表可以调整 Agent 出现的顺序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit Manifest": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑清单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can’t preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” isn’t a supported image.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”不是受支持的图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SSH connection is closed. Reconnect in the terminal, then refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 连接已关闭。请在终端中重新连接，然后刷新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can’t browse %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法浏览 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
